<view class="prop-page"><view class="panel"><view class="heading">道具标签</view><view wx:if="{{sku}}">{{sku.fields.propName}} · {{qr.targetType==='SN'?'A 类实物':'B 类数量道具'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{busy && !sku && !message}}" class="mj-read-state"><mj-loading label="正在读取标签资料"/></view><view class="feedback error" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view><button wx:if="{{loginRequired}}" bindtap="login">登录后继续</button><button bindtap="scan">扫描道具码</button><block wx:if="{{qr}}"><view class="panel"><view>{{qr.propName}}</view><view class="muted">SKU：{{qr.skuCode}}</view><view wx:if="{{qr.snCode}}">SN：{{qr.snCode}} · {{instanceState}}</view><view wx:if="{{sku}}" class="muted">{{sku.factoryName}} · {{sku.fields.materialDesc}} · {{sku.fields.remark||'—'}}</view></view><view class="panel" wx:if="{{qr.status==='revoked'}}"><view class="heading">此标签已停用</view><view>请停止使用该码，返回库存页查看当前活动标签。</view></view><view class="panel" wx:elif="{{qr.imageStatus==='ready'}}"><view class="heading">{{completed?'贴标已确认':'标签图片'}}</view><image wx:if="{{qr.image}}" class="qr-image" src="{{qr.image.url}}" binderror="imageError"/><view class="empty" wx:else>图片暂不可预览，请刷新</view><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !qr.image}}">下载同一张标签</button></view><view class="panel" wx:elif="{{qr.imageStatus==='failed'}}"><view class="heading">图片暂未生成</view><view>重试继续生成同一张标签，不增加实物或库存。</view><button bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy||!qr.canRetryImage}}">重试图片</button></view><view class="panel" wx:else><view class="heading">标签图片生成中</view><view>道具已经审核通过，正在准备标签图片。</view></view><view class="panel" wx:if="{{qr.status==='bound' && qr.targetType==='SKU'}}"><view class="heading">已登记库存 {{stock.totalQuantity}}</view><view>当前可用 {{stock.availableQuantity}}。扫码只识别，不重复入账。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="recognize" loading="{{busy && !returnRefresh}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认识别</button></view><view class="panel" wx:elif="{{qr.canConfirmLabel}}"><view class="heading">确认实物标签</view><view>核对实物与此标签一致后确认，实物将从待贴标转为空闲。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="confirm" loading="{{busy && !returnRefresh}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认贴标</button></view><button bindtap="load" loading="{{busy && !returnRefresh}}">刷新状态</button></block></view>

<login-sheet visible="{{loginVisible}}" return-path="{{loginReturnPath}}" bindclose="closeLogin" bindauthenticated="loginSucceeded"/>
